# The work laptop. Included from ~/.ssh/config when `uname -s` is Darwin.
#
# Keep every keyword here valid on Linux too: this file is parsed on phoenix
# even though the Match gate stops it applying there. In particular
# UseKeychain belongs in ~/.dotoverrides/ssh/ on the laptop, not here — it is
# a fatal parse error on Linux. See ~/.ssh/config.

# Same 1Password agent, different socket: on macOS it lives inside the app's
# group container. Quoted because the path contains spaces.
IdentityAgent "~/Library/Group Containers/2BUA8C4S2C.com.1password/t/agent.sock"
